# Walkthrough - Eden Pre-Deployment Audit Resolution

This walkthrough details all the code modifications implemented to resolve the security vulnerabilities, bugs, data isolation issues, database waterfalls, pagination needs, caching revalidation problems, and type errors identified during the Eden application pre-deployment audits.

---

## 🛠️ Security & Bug Fixes

### 1. Middleware Session Cookie Persistence on Redirects
*   **File modified:** [middleware.ts](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/services/supabase/middleware.ts#L96-L108)
*   **Fix details:** Extracted updated session cookies from the main middleware response and appended them directly to both `isAuthRoute` and `isProtectedRoute` redirect responses (`NextResponse.redirect`). This prevents session loss or redirect loops when tokens refresh during redirect operations.

---

### 2. Sanitized Open Redirect Vectors
*   **Files modified:** 
    *   [route.ts (auth/callback)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/auth/callback/route.ts#L7-L11)
    *   [page.tsx (auth/confirm)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/auth/confirm/page.tsx#L16-L19)
*   **Fix details:** Added regex-based checks to ensure that the `next` query parameter does not begin with an external URL scheme (`http:`, `https:`) or double slashes (`//`). If an external URL is matched, the redirection defaults back to the safe `/onboarding` path.

---

### 3. Eliminated Onboarding Privilege Escalation
*   **Files modified:** 
    *   [actions.ts (onboarding)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/onboarding/actions.ts#L6-L21)
    *   [faculty-selector.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/components/onboarding/faculty-selector.tsx#L31)
*   **Fix details:** Removed the client-supplied `role` parameter from the `assignFaculty` server action entirely and hardcoded the role value to `'STUDENT'` inside the server function. Updated the client component invocation to only supply `facultyId` and `facultySlug`. This ensures new users cannot assign themselves the `'ADMIN'` role.

---

### 4. Resolved Support Provider Crash
*   **File modified:** [support-provider.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/providers/support-provider.tsx#L34-L66)
*   **Fix details:** Modified the select query inside the initialization and auth state change hooks to target the `users` table instead of the `profiles` table to pull `full_name`. This aligns with the database schema design where name is stored in `users.full_name` rather than `profiles.full_name`.

---

### 5. Bound Course Deletion Scope
*   **File modified:** [actions.ts (courses)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/courses/actions.ts#L96-L99)
*   **Fix details:** Added a `.eq("faculty_id", facultyId)` constraint to the database deletion call inside the `deleteCourseAction` server action. This binds the course deletion scope to the validated tenant workspace, preventing cross-tenant delete attempts.

---

### 6. Fixed Settings Client Theme Persistence
*   **File modified:** [settings-client.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/settings/settings-client.tsx#L3-L525)
*   **Fix details:** Replaced DOM class list mutations (`document.documentElement.classList.add/remove`) with standard `next-themes` calls (`setTheme("light")` / `setTheme("dark")` / `setTheme("system")`). Theme preferences are now correctly stored in LocalStorage, preventing flashing when routing.

---

### 7. Completed Schema Migrations Setup File
*   **File modified:** [supabase_schema.md](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/supabase_schema.md)
*   **Fix details:** Replaced the incomplete database migration file with a consolidated production database SQL schema script containing all missing tables (`announcements`, `courses`, `lessons`, `notifications`, `user_lesson_progress`, `reports`), columns, triggers, RLS policies, and RPC routines.

