### 9. Server-Side Range Pagination
*   **Files modified:**
    *   [reports/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/reports/page.tsx)
    *   [users/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/users/page.tsx)
    *   [users-client.tsx](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/users/users-client.tsx)
*   **Fix details:** 
    *   Implemented server-side `.range(from, to)` querying with a page size of 6 on the Reports list page and rendered pagination controls.
    *   Reconfigured User Directory from client-side filtering to complete server-side filtering and paginated query fetching.
    *   Used Supabase `.or` queries with `{ foreignTable: 'users' }` on an inner join (`users!inner(...)`) to filter the directory records by search terms. Added client debouncing (450ms) to prevent URL spamming.

---

### 10. Corrected revalidatePath Scopes
*   **Files modified:**
    *   [settings/actions.ts](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/settings/actions.ts)
    *   [messages/actions.ts](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/messages/actions.ts)
*   **Fix details:** Replaced `revalidatePath("/dashboard")` calls with global `revalidatePath("/", "layout")` calls. This ensures Next.js router cache correctly invalidates all sub-routes when updating faculty settings or publishing announcements/messages.

