## 🏗️ Compilation & Type Validations

### 11. Type Correction in Dashboard page.tsx
*   **File modified:** [page.tsx (dashboard)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/page.tsx#L34-L36)
*   **Fix details:** Defined the missing `role` variable by pulling it from the retrieved `facultyAccess` object and checking for fallback logic. Added safety redirects. This resolves compile-time error: `Type error: Cannot find name 'role'.`

---

### 12. Database-Level Filtering and Payload Optimization
*   **File modified:** [page.tsx (dashboard)](file:///c:/Users/CT/Documents/Applications/eden/app/dashboard/%5BfacultySlug%5D/page.tsx#L102-L130)
*   **Fix details:** Refactored the dashboard queries for verified members and HQ leaders to filter active fields (`is_verified = true` and `leadership_role != null`) directly in the database using PostgREST nested inner joins (`users:user_id!inner(profiles!inner(...))`), limiting the retrieved rows to 50 instead of loading the entire user database table. This resolves the page latency bottleneck for faculties with 10,000+ users.

